{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body><p>更新時間：19:27 2026-11-01 HKT<br/>發佈時間：14:58 2026-11-01 HKT</p>\n<p>發佈時間：14:58 2026-11-01 HKT</p><img src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/f9eae5bf79f4eee47e37a08b4ec19ade/2026-11/collage.jpg\"/><p>將軍澳發生交通意外。今日（11月1日）下午12時49分，一輛私家車在佳景路近新都城對開，與一輛電單車相撞。55歲電單車男司機人仰車翻，並遭捲入車底受困。救援人員接報到場，將鐵騎士救出，他臉部胸部受傷幸仍清醒，由救護車送院治理。</p><p>警方經調查後，相信當時電單車駛至欣景路佳景路交界時，在讓路口停下，但後方私家車收掣不及將他撞到。目前私家車66歲男司機涉嫌危險駕駛被捕，案件正由東九龍交通意外調查隊跟進。</p><img alt=\"電單車男司機人仰車翻，並遭捲入車底受困。FB：Sam Hk\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/3cab8de30b2c94ceaaf9b2894c58a174/2026-11/t2.png\"/><img alt=\"現場為將軍澳佳景路。FB：Sam Hk\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/bfba3d87197cafda5418247607cf0b93/2026-11/1_4_1.jpg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場救援。FB：Sam Hk\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/a3d2b5d9c926218d294eb8e41dd42aeb/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-01_at_16_46_34.jpeg\"/><img alt=\"消防到場救援。FB：Sam Hk\" src=\"https://image.hkhl.hk/f/1024p0/0x0/100/none/735c70039465976e0eabe1d2895f969e/2026-11/WhatsApp_Image_2026-11-01_at_16_46_33_1_.jpeg\"/><p>最Hit</p>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-11-02T00:47:47.636801+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":282,"images":5,"source":"星島頭條","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-11-01T11:27:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:05.506105+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-11-02T00:42:05.506105+00:00","content_hash":"81c008c7c3fd6aa3f844ad2de3c9a5f56f6297629532787bc838395801ecb571","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":null,"content_capture":null}